<p>Destroys one of your summons, making it detonate in radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8.</acronym><li> Ritch Flamespitter: Explodes into a fireball dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> damage, flameshocking damaged foes</li><li> Hydra: Grants <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 22%, 29%, 33%, 36%</acronym> lightning, acid, and nature affinity as well as <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">22, 30, 36, 41, 46</acronym> life regen per turn to all friendly creatures for 7 turns</li><li> Rimebark: Explodes into an iceball dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> ice damage, possibly freezing damaged foes</li><li> Fire Drake: Explodes into a cloud of lingering fire, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">71, 95, 114, 131, 145</acronym> damage per turn</li><li> War Hound: Explodes into a sharp ball, cutting all creatures for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">52, 70, 84, 96, 107</acronym> bleeding damage per turn for 6 turns</li><li> Jelly: Explodes into a ball of slowing slime, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">152, 205, 246, 281, 311</acronym> nature damage and slowing foes by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">21%, 32%, 38%, 42%, 45%</acronym></li><li> Minotaur: Confuses foes at <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 23%, 27%, 30%, 32%</acronym> power for 5 turns</li><li> Stone Golem: Grants <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15, 21, 25, 29, 33</acronym> armour and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">22%, 30%, 38%, 45%, 53%</acronym> armour hardiness to all friendly creatures for 5 turns</li><li> Turtle: Grants a small shell shield to all friendly creatures, granting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">19%, 26%, 31%, 36%, 40%</acronym> all resist for 5 turns</li><li> Spider: Knocks back all foes <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 5, 6</acronym> tiles</li></ul><p>In addition, a random summon will come off cooldown.</p><p>Hostile effects will not hit you or your other summons.</p><p>The effects improve with your mindpower, and some can crit.</p>